desc:`Naomi Osaka is INFP. She withdrew from Roland Garros in 2021 rather than do the mandatory press conferences, explaining that they conflicted with her mental health. This was not a performance. The Fi had assessed the specific institutional requirement as incompatible with what the interior needed to function, and the inferior Te's most available management of the conflict was the direct statement rather than the strategic accommodation. She is one of the most gifted athletes of her generation and one of the most honest people in professional sport about what professional sport costs.`,
