desc:`Harvey Dent is ENTJ. He was the most effective public official Gotham had seen in decades, prosecuting organised crime with institutional authority and genuine personal conviction. His transformation into Two-Face is not a personality change - it is the ENTJ's inferior Fi, which had been managed under extraordinary pressure, releasing all at once when the pressure exceeds the management capacity. The coin does not replace his judgment. It replaces the inferior function entirely, outsourcing the moral calculus to chance because the Te can no longer trust the Fi to provide accurate input.`,
