desc:`Legolas is ISTP. He announces what he sees before anyone else has seen it - not from a need to be helpful but because the Se-Ti combination is constantly reading the environment at maximum resolution and the output is immediate and precise. He does not deliberate in combat. He reads the situation, the Ti assesses the most available move, and the body implements before the deliberation phase would have begun. His friendship with Gimli is built entirely on demonstrated capability under pressure - the ISTP's most honest relationship foundation.`,
