desc:`Greg Heffley is ENTP. He documents everything in a journal he insists is not a diary, generates schemes faster than the inferior Si can model their consequences, and has a consistent pattern of being genuinely cleverer than his circumstances and genuinely unable to convert that cleverness into outcomes anyone around him would call good. His relationship with Rowley is the ENTP's most honest relationship portrait: someone who is loyal and warm and repeatedly used as an instrument because the Ne is already three moves ahead and has assessed Rowley as the most available resource for the current scheme.`,
